BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 547.89 Td (CrisisChain is a mission-critical web application engineered to bridge the critical information gap) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 534.39 Td (during civil emergencies, natural disasters, and industrial accidents. Built with a reactive React \(Vite\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 520.89 Td (frontend, an Express.js \(Node.js\) backend, and a relational MySQL 8.0 storage engine, CrisisChain) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 507.39 Td (orchestrates emergency reporting, tactical unit dispatching, multi-agency resource allocation, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 493.89 Td (hospital bed/ambulance management into a unified command and control system. By combining geospatial) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 480.39 Td (incident mapping, intelligent positioning anomaly detection, atomic inventory reservation, and role-based) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 466.89 Td (operational dashboards, CrisisChain reduces emergency response times from hours to seconds while) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 453.39 Td (maintaining complete data consistency and auditability.) Tj ET
