BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 380.89 Td (During major crises such as urban fires, seasonal flash floods, structural collapses, and mass-casualty) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 367.39 Td (transport accidents traditional emergency communication channels become bottlenecked. Disjointed phone) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 353.89 Td (lines, lack of centralized dispatching, and opaque inventory tracking cause severe resource) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 340.39 Td (misallocation: ambulances are dispatched to resolved incidents, hospitals receive surges beyond ICU bed) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 326.89 Td (capacity, and responders operate without geospatial intelligence or photographic damage assessments.) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 309.39 Td (CrisisChain addresses these systemic vulnerabilities by providing an integrated, multi-role digital) Tj ET
