BT /F3 8 Tf 53 434.39 Td (-- 1. Lock resource row to prevent concurrent race conditions) Tj ET
BT /F3 8 Tf 53 423.89 Td (SELECT resource_id, resource_type, quantity_available) Tj ET
BT /F3 8 Tf 53 413.39 Td (FROM resource) Tj ET
BT /F3 8 Tf 53 402.89 Td (WHERE resource_id = ?) Tj ET
BT /F3 8 Tf 53 392.39 Td (FOR UPDATE;) Tj ET
BT /F3 8 Tf 53 381.89 Td () Tj ET
BT /F3 8 Tf 53 371.39 Td (-- 2. Verify stock \(application check: quantity_available >= requested_qty\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 8 Tf 53 360.89 Td (-- 3. Deduct stock atomically) Tj ET
BT /F3 8 Tf 53 350.39 Td (UPDATE resource) Tj ET
BT /F3 8 Tf 53 339.89 Td (SET quantity_available = quantity_available - ?) Tj ET
BT /F3 8 Tf 53 329.39 Td (WHERE resource_id = ?;) Tj ET
