BT /F2 9.5 Tf 47 531.89 Td (1.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 61 531.89 Td (Authentication: Industry-standard JSON Web Tokens \(JWT\) signed with HMAC SHA-256 \(`HS256`\). Tokens) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 61 518.39 Td (carry user IDs and roles in the payload, validated on every protected endpoint via the `auth`) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 61 504.89 Td (middleware.) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 47 489.39 Td (2.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 61 489.39 Td (Password Security: Salted hashing with bcryptjs \(cost factor 10\). Plaintext passwords are never) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 61 475.89 Td (logged, stored, or transmitted in responses.) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 47 460.39 Td (3.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 61 460.39 Td (Role-Based Access Control \(RBAC\): Middleware `authorize\(['admin', 'hospital']\)` strictly validates) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 61 446.89 Td (operational routes. Unauthorized access attempts yield `403 Forbidden`.) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 47 431.39 Td (4.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 61 431.39 Td (Injection Prevention: 100% of SQL queries utilize parameterized placeholders \(`?`\) executed through) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 61 417.89 Td (`mysql2/promise`. No string concatenation is used in SQL statements.) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 47 402.39 Td (5.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 61 402.39 Td (DDoS & Memory Exhaustion Protection:) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 47 386.89 Td ( ) Tj ET
