0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 47 371.39 Td ( ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 61 371.39 Td (Express Rate Limiting: 100 requests per 15 minutes per IP address.) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 47 355.89 Td (6.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 61 355.89 Td (Strict CORS Policy: Restricted strictly to client origin \(`http://localhost:5173`\). Wildcard origins) Tj ET
