BT /F1 9.5 Tf 61 313.39 Td (`X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff`, and applies clickjacking prevention \(`X-Frame-Options:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 61 299.89 Td (SAMEORIGIN`\).) Tj ET
